      "content": "idk, it feels deeper than just pretending. it feels like i'm fundamentally broken or something. like no matter how much i try to learn the rules, there's this wall between me and everyone else that's never gonna go away. it's just so much work to exist sometimes. i'm just so exhausted by it all.",
